{
  "title": "The Inscription to Be Written and Kept with the Dead",
  "data": "Shaykh al-Tusi adds: The following inscription should be written on the sheet that is placed with the dead along with the palm-leaf stalk. Before writing it, the writer is advised to say the following:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ اَشْهَدُ اَنْ لَّاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ وَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهٗ وَرَسُوْلُهٗ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEMI ASH-HADU AL LAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WAHDAHOO LAA SHAREEKA LAHOO WA ASH-HADU ANNA MUHAMMADAN A'BDUHOO WA RASOOLUHOO SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nIn the Name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful. I bear witness that there is no god but Allah, One, having no partner, and I bear witness that Muhammad is His servant and His Messenger, may Allah bless him and his Household;\nوَاَنَّ الْجَنَّةَ حَقٌّ وَاَنَّ النَّارَ حَقٌّ وَاَنَّ السَّاعَةَ حَقٌّ اٰتِيَةٌ لَا رَيْبَ فِيْهَا وَاَنَّ اللّٰهَ يَبْعَثُ مَنْ فِى الْقُبُوْرِ\nWA ANNAL JANNATA HAQQUN WA ANNAN NAARA HAQQUN WA ANNAS SAA'ATA HAQQUN AATIYATUN LAA RAYBA FEEHAA WA ANNALLAAHA YAB'ATHU MAN FIL QUBOOR\nand that Paradise is true, the Fire is true, and the Hour is true and will come, there is no doubt about it, and that Allah will raise up those who are in the graves.\nOnly then may this inscription be written:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ شَهِدَ الشُّهُوْدُ الْمُسَمَّوْنَ فِىْ هٰذَا الْكِتَابِ اَنَّ اَخَاهُمْ فِى اللّٰهِ عَزَّ وَجَلَّ فُلَانَ بْنَ فُلَانٍ\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEMI SHAHIDASH SHUHOODUL MUSAMMAWNA FEE HAADHAL KITAABI ANNA AKHAAHUM FILLAAHI A'ZZA WA JALLA FULAANABNA FULAAN\nIn the Name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful. The witnesses named in this document bear witness that their brother in Allah, the Mighty and Majestic, so-and-so, the son of so-and-so,\nاَشْهَدَهُمْ وَاسْتَوْدَعَهُمْ وَاَقَرَّ عِنْدَهُمْ اَنَّهٗ يَشْهَدُ اَنْ لَّاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّا اللّٰهُ وَحْدَهٗ لَا شَرِيْكَ لَهٗ\nASH-HADAHUM WASTAWDA'AHUM WA AQARRA I'NDAHUM ANNAHOO YASH-HADU AL LAA ILAAHA ILLALLAAHU WAHDAHOO LAA SHAREEKA LAH\nhas called them to witness, entrusted to them and affirmed before them that he bears witness that there is no god but Allah, One, having no partner,\nوَاَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ عَبْدُهٗ وَرَسُوْلُهٗ وَاَنَّهٗ مُقِرٌّ بِجَمِيْعِ الْاَنْبِيَاۤءِ وَالرُّسُلِ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ\nWA ANNA MUHAMMADAN SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIHEE A'BDUHOO WA RASOOLUHOO WA ANNAHOO MUQIRRUN BIJAMEE'IL ANBIYAA'I WAR RUSULI A'LAYHIMUS SALAAM\nand that Muhammad, may Allah bless him and his Household, is His servant and His Messenger; that he affirms all the prophets and messengers, peace be upon them;\nوَاَنَّ عَلِيًّا وَلِىُّ اللّٰهِ وَاِمَامُهٗ وَاَنَّ الْاَئِمَّةَ مِنْ وُلْدِهٖ اَئِمَّتُهٗ\nWA ANNA A'LIYYAN WALIYYULLAAHI WA IMAAMUHOO WA ANNAL A'IMMATA MIN WULDIHEE A'IMMATUH\nthat Ali is the guardian appointed by Allah and his Imam, and that the Imams from his descendants are his Imams;\nوَاَنَّ اَوَّلَهُمُ الْحَسَنُ وَالْحُسَيْنُ وَعَلِىُّ بْنُ الْحُسَيْنِ وَمُحَمَّدُ بْنُ عَلِىٍّ وَجَعْفَرُ بْنُ مُحَمَّدٍ وَمُوْسَى بْنُ جَعْفَرٍ\nWA ANNA AWWALAHUMUL HASANU WAL HUSAYNU WA A'LIYYUBNUL HUSAYNI WA MUHAMMADUBNU A'LIYYIN WA JA'FARUBNU MUHAMMADIN WA MOOSABNU JA'FAR\nand that the first of them are al-Hasan, al-Husayn, Ali ibn al-Husayn, Muhammad ibn Ali, Ja'far ibn Muhammad, Musa ibn Ja'far,\nوَعَلِىُّ بْنُ مُوْسٰى وَمُحَمَّدُ بْنُ عَلِىٍّ وَعَلِىُّ بْنُ مُحَمَّدٍ وَالْحَسَنُ بْنُ عَلِىٍّ وَالْقَاۤئِمُ الْحُجَّةُ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ\nWA A'LIYYUBNU MOOSAA WA MUHAMMADUBNU A'LIYYIN WA A'LIYYUBNU MUHAMMADIN WAL HASANUBNU A'LIYYIN WAL QAA'IMUL HUJJATU A'LAYHIMUS SALAAM\nAli ibn Musa, Muhammad ibn Ali, Ali ibn Muhammad, al-Hasan ibn Ali, and al-Qa'im, the Proof, peace be upon them;\nوَاَنَّ الْجَنَّةَ حَقٌّ وَالنَّارَ حَقٌّ وَالسَّاعَةَ اٰتِيَةٌ لَا رَيْبَ فِيْهَا وَاَنَّ اللّٰهَ يَبْعَثُ مَنْ فِى الْقُبُوْرِ\nWA ANNAL JANNATA HAQQUN WAN NAARA HAQQUN WAS SAA'ATA AATIYATUN LAA RAYBA FEEHAA WA ANNALLAAHA YAB'ATHU MAN FIL QUBOOR\nthat Paradise is true, the Fire is true, and the Hour will come, there is no doubt about it, and that Allah will raise up those who are in the graves;\nوَاَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ عَبْدُهٗ وَرَسُوْلُهٗ جَاۤءَ بِالْحَقِّ\nWA ANNA MUHAMMADAN SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIHEE A'BDUHOO WA RASOOLUHOO JAA'A BIL HAQQ\nthat Muhammad, may Allah bless him and his Household, is His servant and His Messenger, who brought the truth;\nوَاَنَّ عَلِيًّا وَلِىُّ اللّٰهِ وَالْخَلِيْفَةُ مِنْ بَعْدِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ وَمُسْتَخْلَفُهٗ فِىْۤ اُمَّتِهٖ مُؤَدِّيًا لِاَمْرِ رَبِّهٖ تَبَارَكَ وَتَعَالٰى\nWA ANNA A'LIYYAN WALIYYULLAAHI WAL KHALEEFATU MIN BA'DI RASOOLILLAAHI SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIHEE WA MUSTAKHLAFUHOO FEE UMMATIHEE MU'ADDIYAN LI-AMRI RABBIHEE TABAARAKA WA TA'AALAA\nthat Ali is the guardian appointed by Allah, the successor after the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and his Household, and the one he left in charge of his community, fulfilling the command of his Lord, Blessed and Exalted is He;\nوَاَنَّ فَاطِمَةَ بِنْتُ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ وَابْنَيْهَا الْحَسَنَ وَالْحُسَيْنَ اِبْنَا رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ وَسِبْطَاهُ وَاِمَامَا الْهُدٰى وَقَاۤئِدَا الرَّحْمَةِ\nWA ANNA FAATIMATA BINTU RASOOLILLAAHI WABNAYHAL HASANA WAL HUSAYNA IBNAA RASOOLILLAAHI WA SIBTAAHU WA IMAAMAL HUDAA WA QAA'IDAR RAHMAH\nthat Fatimah is the daughter of the Messenger of Allah, and that her two sons, al-Hasan and al-Husayn, are the sons of the Messenger of Allah and his grandsons, the two Imams of guidance and the two leaders of mercy;\nوَاَنَّ عَلِيًّا وَمُحَمَّدًا وَجَعْفَرًا وَمُوْسٰى وَعَلِيًّا وَمُحَمَّدًا وَعَلِيًّا وَحَسَنًا وَالْحُجَّةَ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ\nWA ANNA A'LIYYAN WA MUHAMMADAN WA JA'FARAN WA MOOSAA WA A'LIYYAN WA MUHAMMADAN WA A'LIYYAN WA HASANAN WAL HUJJATA A'LAYHIMUS SALAAM\nand that Ali, Muhammad, Ja'far, Musa, Ali, Muhammad, Ali, Hasan and the Proof, peace be upon them,\nاَئِمَّةٌ وَقَادَةٌ وَدُعَاةٌ اِلَى اللّٰهِ جَلَّ وَعَلَا وَحُجَّةٌ عَلٰى عِبَادِهٖ\nA'IMMATUN WA QAADATUN WA DU'AATUN ILALLAAHI JALLA WA A'LAA WA HUJJATUN A'LAA I'BAADIH\nare Imams, leaders, and callers to Allah, Majestic and Exalted is He, and His proof over His servants.\nThe writer of this document should then address the witnesses with these words:\nيَا فُلَانُ وَيَا فُلَانُ الْمُسَمَّيْنِ فِىْ هٰذَا الْكِتَابِ اَثْبِتُوْا لِىْ هٰذِهِ الشَّهَادَةَ عِنْدَكُمْ حَتّٰى تَلْقَوْنِىْ بِهَا عَلَى الْحَوْضِ\nYAA FULAANU WA YAA FULAANUL MUSAMMAYNI FEE HAADHAL KITAABI ATHBITOO LEE HAADHIHISH SHAHAADATA I'NDAKUM HATTAA TALQAWNEE BIHAA A'LAL HAWD\nO so-and-so and so-and-so, named in this document! Keep this testimony of mine with you until you meet me with it at the Pool (of al-Kawthar).\nThe witnesses should reply:\nيَا فُلَانُ نَسْتَوْدِعُكَ اللّٰهَ وَالشَّهَادَةُ وَالْاِقْرَارُ وَالْاِخَاۤءُ مَوْدُوْعَةٌ عِنْدَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nYAA FULAANU NASTAWDI'UKALLAAHA WASH SHAHAADATU WAL IQRAARU WAL IKHAA'U MAWDOO'ATUN I'NDA RASOOLILLAAHI SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nO so-and-so, we commend you to Allah; the testimony, the affirmation and the brotherhood are entrusted with the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and his Household.\nوَنَقْرَاُ عَلَيْكَ السَّلَامَ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA NAQRA'U A'LAYKAS SALAAMA WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nWe greet you with peace, and the mercy of Allah and His blessings.\nIn place of “so-and-so”, the names of the dead person and of the witnesses are mentioned. Then the document should be folded, wrapped, and sealed with the seals of both witnesses and of the person whose testimony has been witnessed. It is then placed at the right side of the dead with the palm-leaf stalk. This document, which should be written with camphor (i.e. water in which camphor is mixed) and unscented aloe-wood, should be placed on the dead person's forehead."
}
